    "%@ %@": {
      "comment": "Citation line. The first placeholder is the citation title, the second is the word \"Source\" shown as a link.\nEnergy value with its unit. The placeholders are an amount and the unit \"Cals\".\nMonitor card subtitle item pairing a metric short name with its deviation direction, e.g. 'HRV low'\nYear in Bloom distance summary followed by a comparison sentence.",
